msgstr "XID 是标准的 OpenID Connect 提供方。"

#: apps/site/src/content-source/docs/message-descriptors.ts
msgid "XID is an identity provider. The instance domain is the OIDC issuer, API base URL, Hosted Auth base URL, and console base URL. Organizations provide policy, branding, membership, and resource isolation."
msgstr "XID 是身份提供方。实例域名是 OIDC 签发方、API 基础 URL、Hosted Auth 基础 URL 和控制台基础 URL。组织提供策略、品牌、成员关系和资源隔离。"

#: apps/site/src/lib/home-surface.ts
msgid "XID is one identity product for your app and your customers: hosted sign-in and accounts, OpenID Connect for your apps, organizations with enterprise SSO and SCIM, and one console. Free on XID Cloud, MIT licensed to self-host."
msgstr "XID 是一个身份产品，同时服务你的应用和你的客户：托管登录和账户、面向应用的 OpenID Connect、带企业 SSO 和 SCIM 的组织，以及一个控制台。在 XID Cloud 上免费，以 MIT 许可自托管。"

#: apps/site/src/lib/home-surface.ts
