msgstr "你的账户将于 {deletionDate} 删除"

#: apps/server/src/routes/account/DeleteAccountPage.tsx
msgid "Your account will be deleted on {deletionDate}. Until then you can sign in and cancel from this page. After {deletionDate}, what you'll lose can't be recovered."
msgstr "你的账户将于 {deletionDate} 删除。在此之前，你可以登录并在此页面取消。{deletionDate} 之后，你失去的内容将无法恢复。"

#: apps/server/src/routes/mfa-setup/index.tsx
msgid "Your admin turned this on for everyone. Setup takes about two minutes, then you'll go straight back."
msgstr "管理员为所有人开启了此要求。设置大约需要两分钟，完成后会直接返回。"

#: apps/site/src/lib/home-surface.ts
msgid "Your app redirects to XID and gets the user back with tokens. Afterward, people manage their sessions, devices and data on their own account page."
msgstr "你的应用跳转到 XID，再带着令牌把用户接回来。之后，用户在自己的账户页面管理会话、设备和数据。"

#: apps/site/src/lib/home-surface.ts
msgid "Your auth vendor shouldn't be in every service."
msgstr "你的认证服务商不该出现在每个服务里。"

#: apps/server/src/routes/account/DeleteAccountPage.tsx
msgid "your authenticator app"
msgstr "你的认证器应用"

#: apps/server/src/routes/account/TwoStepSection.tsx
msgid "Your authenticator app is your last two-step method. Text message codes and backup codes stop working too, because they can't be used on their own."
msgstr "认证器应用是你最后一种两步验证方式。短信验证码和备用码也会失效，因为它们不能单独使用。"

#: apps/site/src/lib/home-surface.ts
msgid "Your biggest deal is waiting on SSO and SCIM."
msgstr "你最大的那单生意在等 SSO 和 SCIM。"

#: apps/server/src/routes/create-passkey/PromptViews.tsx
